        {"zh": "我的痛苦转化成火焰！", "en": "My pain turns to flames!"},
        {"zh": "黑暗中我是唯一的光亮！", "en": "In darkness, I am the light!"},
        {"zh": "我是不死之魂，你的恐惧！", "en": "I am the unending spirit, your fear!"},
